{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14212300","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14212300","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1421230001:0":{"text":"크흠, 혹시 누가 이걸 듣고 있을까? 테스트, 테스트...","source_cn":"咳咳，有人能看到这段留言吗？测试，测试……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F92BF3B2278B7F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1421230002:1":{"text":"이게 첫 녹음인데, 잘 됐겠지?","source_cn":"这是我第一次试录，应该没问题吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A9F18DD12F0A60D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1421230003:1":{"text":"음, 내 실력을 믿어야지. 나 페리엘이라면 분명 문제 없을 거야!","source_cn":"唔，我得对自己的水平有点信心！斐利尔肯定没问题！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC824616EE6DC4167","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1421230004:1":{"text":"우왓, 혹시 지금 그 말도 녹음된 건 아니겠지... 어떡하지? 삭제 버튼이...","source_cn":"哇，我刚刚说的那段是不是被记录下来了……糟糕，怎么删除啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E876727CA968A63","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1421230005:1":{"text":"됐다, 아무도 안 볼 거고. 일단 이렇게 하자! 일단 본론으로 들어가면...","source_cn":"算了算了，也不一定有人看，先就这样吧！下面开始说正事——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x83E08F6B67B9E259","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1421230006:1":{"text":"헤헤, 이걸 듣고 있다는 건 너희가 내 실험의 숲을 찾아냈다는 뜻이겠지!","source_cn":"嘿嘿，如果你们看到这个，说明已经找到我的实验林地啦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC13A88198469773","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1421230007:1":{"text":"예쁘지 않아? 내가 엄청 공들였다고.","source_cn":"那里是不是很漂亮？我可是花了好多心思呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70F9452FB7B6AC42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1421230008:1":{"text":"여길 발견했으니 너희에게 선물을 줄게!","source_cn":"为了奖励你们的发现，我要送你们一些礼物！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D3467FE797D7D4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1421230009:1":{"text":"잘 들어! 내가 아주아주 특별한 곳에 보물을 숨겨놨는데...","source_cn":"听好啦！我在一个特别特别隐秘的地方藏了一些宝物——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8819D477F60CA36F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1421230010:1":{"text":"내가 갑자기 너그럽게 군다고 놀라지 마. 내 마법을 풀 수 있는 사람이라면 분명 내 친구일 테니까!","source_cn":"别觉得我突然大方呢，只是能破解我的魔法找到那里的人，一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC4FB0C67516DF33","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1421230011:0":{"text":"히히, 힘내! 그리고 보물을 찾으면 나한테 꼭 대단하다고 말해주는 거다?","source_cn":"嘿嘿，你们加油！要是找到宝藏，记得跟我说好厉害！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3F9A3309F3135CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:13:1421230012:0":{"text":"기억의 영상이 사라진 뒤, 모두가 침묵에 빠졌다...","source_cn":"回忆影像消失，所有人也陷入了沉默……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30AEE10C98DDC17C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1421230013:1":{"text":"...이런 순간에도 자기 자랑하는 건 잊지 않는군요.","source_cn":"……就算是这种时候，还在炫耀自己的魔法能力。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE6F1C6925CDFAFF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1421230014:1":{"text":"...유치하긴.","source_cn":"……真是个幼稚鬼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22EF3799611B346A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1421230015:1":{"text":"흑흑, 페리엘 님...","source_cn":"呜呜，斐利尔大人……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE0F3D9511C23CAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1421230016:1":{"text":"보고 싶어요...","source_cn":"我、我好想你……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09EFA55C70D8F9E9","variant_sta